":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320612005:1":{"text":"我想……他濒临极限，快坚持不下去了。","source_cn":"我想……他濒临极限，快坚持不下去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1F0B9335F3EA24B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320612006:1":{"text":"怎么会这样，谁会对铐兰做出这么残忍的事情？！","source_cn":"怎么会这样，谁会对铐兰做出这么残忍的事情？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2D3CE95E8349225","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320612007:1":{"text":"会是恶魔或是眷属吗……？你说过，魔物大举入侵的时候，拉季诺夫家族站在前线奋勇反抗。","source_cn":"会是恶魔或是眷属吗……？你说过，魔物大举入侵的时候，拉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x646ADA5A712C6E98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320612008:1":{"text":"难道它们攻破拉季诺夫庄园之后，作为报复，他们把当时还活着的铐兰……","source_cn":"难道它们攻破拉季诺夫庄园之后，作为报复，他们把当时还活...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2046D7F445CF500A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320612009:1":{"text":"请——请不要说了……！","source_cn":"请——请不要说了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x654021B1A2DD02DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320612010:0":{"text":"……你还是听到了。","source_cn":"……你还是听到了。","status":"matched",